,"site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-08-08T23:57:26Z","updated_at":"2016-08-08T23:57:26Z","body":"Oh right, I can reproduce this now. I was assuming you were sideloading the `.srt` subtitle file (playback works correctly if you do this), but you're actually embedding the subtitle in the `.mp4` file.\n\nThere's a pretty big piece of information missing here. How are you doing the embedding? You must be using some kind of tool or utility to do that. Are you sure that the tool works correctly in the case of the input containing font tags? It's notable that QuickTime player doesn't appear to play the captions in your sample video quite right either. If I had to guess, I'd say the media is not formatted correctly.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/238413621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/238418001","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1712#issuecomment-238418001","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1712","id":238418001,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIzODQxODAwMQ==","user":{"login":"cstew","id":42011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew","html_url":"https://github.com/cstew","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-08-09T00:24:08Z","updated_at":"2016-08-09T00:24:08Z","body":"You're right that the colors aren't correct in Quicktime. They do work fine in VLC and I believe they work in iOS's media player. The subtitle text does show up correctly in each of these (which is the important part for me).\n\nI'm using Handbrake to encode the subtitles. \n\nThe issue for me is that I have a vendor that is supplying video files with embedded subtitles. These subtitles have a `<font size=\"24\">` tag in them which I would happily ignore. The subtitles do playback correctly in the iOS version of the app I'm working on (with the font size ignored). I don't know why the vendor has that font tag and I am trying to work with them to get it removed, but I'm not sure how much progress I will be able to make there.  \n\nI was able to reproduce this issue with the sample file you see above with the font color attribute as a test. I tried my best to strip things down to identify where the problem occurs. If you'd like a copy of the original file that prompted all of this, I'd be happy to send it along privately. \n\nThat is very interesting that sideloading the `.srt` file works correctly. I may be able to work around this problem using that. \n\nThanks for your help. I really do appreciate all of the free effort that you put into the project. Let me know if there's anything I can do to contribute to the issue, or if you judge this to not be a priority at the moment. \n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/238418001/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cstew","id":42011,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42011?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew","html_url":"https://github.com/cstew","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cstew/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/238502973","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1712#issuecomment-238502973","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1